  "body": "The command cache could not consume source events recorded before identity/cache attachment, and it had no buffer-deletion API. This adds a bounded observer adapter that copies bootstrap events, replays through CPU no-ops, and applies live events without repeating original GL calls. Per-context PBO tracking resets a deleted bound PBO before FBO readiness; context/current/deferred-destroy state and copied framebuffer deletion retain the existing cache semantics.\n\nPublic metadata gates reconcile source counters AND require an idle source scope through an additive same-translation-unit activity signal. The old runtime is included unchanged. The previous Panda SDK lacks this new symbol and is explicitly NOT adapter-link-qualified; it is inspected only as DATA. Future actual SDK/image integration/rebuild is required. No capture/bridge arming, loader, GL query or native activation is added.\n\nFinal HEAD:1555e3096afbb9c1e177eb6cbc5659341101b4f7; implementation67e371fbdbca98922b2b1d92294fe35403f1a49d. Basefeature/panda-source-dispatch-v1 at55ab312dcded2a55640a560441010f8f2737531d; this PR stays Draft and unmerged.\n\nVerification:\n\n- 21focusedPASS9.006s;1485fulltests/1478PASS/7skip112.947s.\n- 50normal+50ASan/UBSan CPU scenarios,100executions with identical JSON and expected accept/reject results. Bootstrap/live preserve8state originals+1rawread,5versus0replayed events.\n- 18source hashes including transitive ABI/helpers; all10compiler project dependencies recorded via per-TU -MMD. Readelf uses absolute hashed tool through sanitized bounded process-group runner; ambient PATH, timeout/output and source/header mutation regressions pass.\n- One fresh whole-branch review at27d073a:0Critical/3Important/0Minor. All3Important reproduced/fixed in one TDDpass: unresolved lookup observation, ambient/unbounded static inspection, missing transitive ABI pin. All8reviewer-declined behaviors have executor rulings/costs; no rereview/minor polishing.\n- 535indexedproofs/4,833,729bytes Git-tracked;549addedfiles/0basefilechanges; clean checkout. Before-review evidence is retained unchanged; after-fix/selected-cpu.json is final local evidence.\n\nAll3329basefiles/299oldpins/10originals/main/Drafts102\u2013110/eightnativehistories preserved. No Cloud/registry publication, main/shared-base merge/push, consumed native request reuse or new native/GL/provider/model/officialORT run. Native allowance0, original official MD-V3 strict0/4FAIL, Stage7INCOMPLETE. No new RGB/I420/officialONNX equality or first-divergence figures/native artifacts are claimed.\n\nCaller-owned valid disjoint spans/lifetimes, serialized owner lifecycle, normal returns/noGL/no throw-longjmp, and exclusive attached-cache ownership remain preconditions. Combined finish status is not an authenticated producer/sink receipt. Actual compiled branch/name/alias/safe256profile, full Python/MetaDrive image, mapped ABI/camera/allocation/lifetime/environment and fresh bounded ON/OFF contract remain gates. The retained old Panda candidate SHA228b2d88e91fa9c5ded10cfe8e93f9b9519de881a37765a0e8681af6e36cf96b lacks psd_source_idle; candidate_adapter_link_qualified=False.\n\nPlan/spec/results/continuation/rulings: docs/superpowers/plans/2026-11-15-panda-cache-adapter.md; docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-15-panda-cache-adapter.md; docs/STAGE7_PANDA_CACHE_ADAPTER_{RESULT,LEDGER,CONTINUATION}.md. Evidence docs/evidence/panda-cache-adapter-01/proof-index.json and selected-cpu.json. Final immutable-head/exactCI/preservation receipt is retained output/stage7-panda-cache-adapter-01/final-verification.json after closeout.\n\nExact final-source CI verified for1555e3096afbb9c1e177eb6cbc5659341101b4f7, workflow411705464:\n- pull_request run[43668550873](https://github.com/rownlvh8875-coder/big-model-closed-loop-benchmark/actions/runs/43668550873),attempt1,SUCCESS,artifacts0; jobs synthetic-unit=132673256725, onnx-interface-test=132673256951.\n- push run[43668547658](https://github.com/rownlvh8875-coder/big-model-closed-loop-benchmark/actions/runs/43668547658),attempt1,SUCCESS,artifacts0; jobs synthetic-unit=132673247330, onnx-interface-test=132673247429.\n\nFinal preservation at2026-11-15T11:39:48.838329+09:00:3329basefiles/299oldpins/10originals/main/Drafts102\u2013110/eightnativehistories unchanged. All4jobsSUCCESS, no native runs. Body roundtrip and open/unmerged Draft verified against final head. ONNX interface uses generated SMALL TEST GRAPH ONLY, never official large model. Retained final-verification.json binds exact HEAD/CI/proof-index/100CPU cases/source-activity requirement and preservation.\n",
